        </p>
        <ul>
            <li/>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0cm">
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif">sia come front-end developer, confrontandomi solitamente con </font><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">backend
		Java-based</font></strong>
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif"> come
                </font><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">tomcat</font></strong>
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif">
                    e </font><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif">LifeRay</font></strong>
                <font face="Arial, sans-serif">,
                </font>
            </p>
